--[[
	The weapons' R15 animations, by `Config/Weapons` entry, from the
	owner's Claude Design kits (`assets/models/weapons/*_r15/`,
	2026-10-23). GENERATED by
	`assets/models/weapons/weapon_animations_to_luau.py`: regenerate, never
	hand-edit. Played in code by `Fx/WeaponPose`.

	Each key is the Transform of every joint the clip moves; joints a clip
	leaves out stay with Roblox's own animation (Hold moves the arms only,
	so the legs still walk). Keys ease Cubic InOut. Markers are seconds
	into the clip: the bow's Draw `Nock` (the hand reaches the string) and
	Fire `Release`, the staff's Cast `Cast`, the greatsword's slashes
	`TrailOn`, `Hit` and `TrailOff`.
]]

